{"resource":{"id":"rust-project-case-study","title":"Rust — Project Case Study","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Intermediate","readingTime":"27 min","pages":34,"lastUpdated":"April 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"How the FerroDesk team designed, built, optimized, tested, deployed, and maintained a scalable Rust backend using modern practices."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Context & Goals"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Architecture"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Development Process"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Optimization"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Testing & Rollout"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Deployment & Ops"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Maintenance & Evolution"},{"id":"diagrams","label":"Architecture Diagrams"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust — Project Guide","tag":"Programming","time":"17 min"},{"title":"Rust — Real-world Case Study","tag":"Programming","time":"19 min"},{"title":"Rust — Best Practices","tag":"Programming","time":"16 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>See a real Rust backend from zero to production.</li>\n          <li>Understand trade-offs at every layer.</li>\n          <li>Learn how the team measured and improved.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Context &amp; Goals</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>Project:</strong> FerroDesk — a multi-tenant support ticketing API serving 12M requests/day. Targets: p99 &lt; 40ms, 99.99% uptime, zero data-loss on failover.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — FerroDesk request-flow overview.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Architecture</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Hexagonal Cargo workspace: <code>api</code>, <code>domain</code>, <code>storage</code>, <code>worker</code>, <code>xtask</code>. axum + tokio + sqlx (Postgres) + Redis Streams for events.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Edge (CF) → API (axum) → Postgres (RW)\n                              ↘ Redis Streams → Worker → Postgres (analytics)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Development Process</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Two-week sprints, ADRs for each major decision, trunk-based development, and mandatory <code>clippy -D warnings</code> before merge.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Optimization</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Change</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Before</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">After</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Bincode over JSON internally</td><td class=\"p-2\">1.9ms</td><td class=\"p-2\">380µs</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">SQL <code>PREPARE</code> caching</td><td class=\"p-2\">42ms</td><td class=\"p-2\">11ms</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Arena allocator for parsing</td><td class=\"p-2\">6% CPU</td><td class=\"p-2\">1.2% CPU</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Testing &amp; Rollout</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>1,240 unit tests + 320 integration tests + fuzz tests on parsers. Canary deploy to 1% → 10% → 100% over 6 hours.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Deployment &amp; Ops</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Distroless container, 12MB binary, deployed via GitOps to Kubernetes with HPA. Prometheus + Grafana + Loki stack.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1667372393119-3d4c48d07fc9?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — GitOps rollout pipeline with automatic rollback on SLO burn.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Maintenance &amp; Evolution</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Weekly <code>cargo update</code>, quarterly toolchain bump, on-call rotates weekly with runbook parity.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"diagrams\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Architecture Diagrams</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Failure domain:\n   AZ-a  ← primary DB\n   AZ-b  ← replica (async, promoted on failover)\n   AZ-c  ← workers</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Deny warnings, forbid unsafe in domain crates.</li>\n          <li>Everything traceable via request-id.</li>\n          <li>Every migration reversible.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Early caching hid a bad N+1 query — measure first.</li>\n          <li>Custom runtime experiments — reverted to stock Tokio.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-red-500/40 bg-red-500/10 text-red-900 dark:text-red-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Lesson</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Don't optimize what you haven't profiled.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Rust rewarded FerroDesk with predictable latencies and boring on-calls — the biggest wins came from process, not micro-optimizations.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Team size?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Six engineers over eight months.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Why Rust over Go?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Existing crypto + parsing hot path benefited from zero-cost abstractions.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">FerroDesk is an illustrative composite; numbers reflect typical outcomes.</p>\n      </div></section>"}